{
  "id": "608",
  "title": "I’ll Bring Something To Eat",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-10-25",
  "synopsis": "Lucy and Ben plan a trip to the beach.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/876/754433fbbb7d83cf0db620ad4804064f6f2fcadb.mp3?1698350555",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我带点吃的去\n\n露西：下周日我们去海边玩，我带点吃的去。\n本：那我呢？\n露西：你带水和水果，怎么样？\n本：好的。\n露西：啊，水太重了，我们到那再买吧。\n本：好的。",
    "traditional": "我帶點吃的去\n\n露西：下週日我們去海邊玩，我帶點吃的去。\n本：那我呢？\n露西：你帶水和水果，怎麼樣？\n本：好的。\n露西：啊，水太重了，我們到那再買吧。\n本：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’ll Bring Something To Eat"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "露西：下周日我们去海边玩，我带点吃的去。",
      "traditional": "露西：下週日我們去海邊玩，我帶點吃的去。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī xià zhōu rì wǒ men qù hǎi biān wán wǒ dài diǎn chī de qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Next Sunday we’re going to the beach to play. I’ll bring something to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：那我呢？",
      "traditional": "本：那我呢？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: What should I do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "露西：你带水和水果，怎么样？",
      "traditional": "露西：你帶水和水果，怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī nǐ dài shuǐ hé shuǐ guǒ zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: You can bring water and fruits. What do you think?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alright."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "露西：啊，水太重了，我们到那再买吧。",
      "traditional": "露西：啊，水太重了，我們到那再買吧。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī a shuǐ tài zhòng le wǒ men dào nà zài mǎi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Ah, water is too heavy. Let’s buy it once we get there."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok."
    }
